<title>USA: Conover, N.C., won by Bankers Bank.</title>
<headline>Conover, N.C., won by Bankers Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Bank of Georgia said it won $2.500 million of Conover, N.C., general obligation sanitary sewer bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.2606 percent.</p>
</text>
